  unitName: Lunatic Warrior Jeanne (EU)
  unitId: 750267
  unitNumber: 7215
  description: "Had Jeanne not joined Heinrich\u2019s Hunters, her fate would have
    been drastically different. Blinded by the voices she heard, she would have lost
    her mind and granted herself the title of \"Chosen One\". She would have interpreted
    the voices as divine will and guided her people towards victory in their rebellion
    against the Shapeshifters."
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: Nobody needs to know what I can hear...
  evoDesc: These voices... They're guiding me! I have a mission to accomplish.
